language Essence 1.3

$ A function defined at no more than 2 of its 6 domain values. This is what FunctionAsRelation is
$ for: the relation stores only the entries the function has, where FunctionExplicit needs a value
$ slot and a definedness flag per domain value whether or not the function uses it. Kept on
$ `heuristic = "x"` so every function representation, that one included, stays covered.
find f : function (maxSize 2) int(1..6) --> int(1..6)
find y : int(1..6)
such that f(1) = 3
such that f(y) = 5
